      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i need some help with the opening ceremony schedule for the medical symposium in Geneva next month. Can you draft a minute-by-minute timeline for the first 2 hours? I need to include AV testing, speaker arrivals, the keynote intro, and when the catering staff should have the welcome coffee ready. It needs to be super tight so we don't fall behind.",
